-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonhide-feet\" title=\"Dragonhide Feet - in 1 of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3d45df5330ab70a2d5c7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonhide Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 1 of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"wyrm-hide\" title=\"Wyrm Hide - in 9 of 9 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 7 total, 3–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/97b6093fa51dfdf6f46d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wyrm Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×3–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"wyrm-tooth\" title=\"Wyrm Tooth - in 6 of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 4 total, 4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/20d4d609ca4b783a9215.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wyrm Tooth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"dragonscale-legs\" title=\"Dragonscale Legs - in 1 of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7c1ec86af5a4c2f2cf54.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×1</spa